- [ ] Confirm final family splitting and Servlet request/response migration are complete.
- [ ] Compile the module for the first time; treat the error list as the remaining-work list.
- [ ] Resolve every reported call site until the build is clean.
- [ ] Confirm a clean build, i.e. no legacy call shape survives anywhere.
- [ ] Confirm MySQL is running with the `login_` schema and the `GI` test user.
